## Comments

### Morality and Ethics

According to the philosophy professor @dlmayhem,
we were given a small definition of morality and ethics.

Morality is a set of rules of conduct established and
accepted by a community. For example, Christian morality,
Mapuche morality, etc.

Ethics is the philosophical study of morality in general.

### FSF

According to @libsys on the FSF's position on LLMs.

There is no concrete position in the FSF on this so far.
Beyond the fact that if someone else is doing the computing for you,
you are not in control of your computing.
